  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "2dd25ab234c8430b8782b5223c4eeedf_13",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Tribunal, however, recorded a finding that the driver of the tanker lorry (which was insured and which was collided with the motorcycle) was not authorized to drive a tanker lorry which was carrying hazardous goods and has, therefore,\na"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4c7fba6e2b4c47948304f2038ad29272_17",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Ex.R2 clearly establishes that the driver of the tanker lorry had undertaken a course and obtained a Training Certificate in relation to transportation of hazardous goods."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f1a53e02271f4bf4b572ba40dc3ffb95_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNC: 2024:KHC:43753 6."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3ec8df7a058540aba73b541c5aa6ad0b_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7. It is therefore clear that the driver of the tanker lorry did possess the necessary certificates to drive a tanker and transport hazardous goods."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "22ced17afb354e8caefc963a8e3966dc_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "8. In this view of the matter, the exoneration of liability of the insurer cannot be sustained and it is held that the insurer would be responsible for payment of the compensation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5b51e653f0a24803b3e65e22bfcc7f32_22",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. Insofar as the claim for enhancement is concerned, the evidence on record indicates that the claimant in MFA No.1442/2018 had suffered fracture of the right femur shaft and the doctor who was examined has stated that he was having functi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2f815488874c45488ae45824d5defac8_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the Tribunal has taken the whole body disability only at 8%.\n10."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "60674bca39564db0a0bea6d68cfa5068_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In my view, taking into consideration that the claimant had suffered a fracture of the right femur shaft, it is appropriate to treat the whole body disability at 15%."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da3e31c437204334bcd75f16289d7aa0_25",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. As far as monthly income is concerned, the Tribunal has concluded that the claimant was earning Rs.7,000/- per month."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "37e836d76234422b8bedfd45d28956ea_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In my view, since there is no evidence to ascertain the actual income,\nnotional income of Rs.9,000/- has to be applied as per the determination made by the Karnataka State Legal Services Authority for accidents of the year 2015."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4e0039b10fd942edb1e064af90365377_27",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. As the claimant was aged 25 years, a multiplier of '18' will have to be applied."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "36017a42ef6e42c8a717e427b6321cda_28",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Consequently, the claimant would be entitled to a sum of Rs.2,91,600/- (Rs.9,000X18X12X15%) towards 'loss of future income'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7fa26512fc384e5d83b1e23006ccd6b8_29",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNC: 2024:KHC:43753 Ramaraj vs Shriram General Insurance Co Ltd on 29 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/167474033/\n4 13."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "045b70ea89f841bdadd67d7fa292007a_30",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Tribunal has awarded a sum of Rs.20,000/- towards 'pain and suffering' and Rs.20,000/-\ntowards 'loss of amenities'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e718e69778f14b75b634760a1b975675_31",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having regard to the fracture to a major bone, it would be appropriate to enhance the said amounts to Rs.50,000/- under each heads."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e5d4cd8d32014df3a6f4519899e29816_32",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. A sum of Rs.1,35,000/- awarded towards 'medical expenses' being based on documentary evidence, is affirmed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c118a118585947e8a090a77225eedb25_33",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. The Tribunal has taken the laid-up period as two months."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f106c0c043ff42ec945cc8191db22347_34",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since the claimant has suffered a fracture to the right foot, it would be appropriate to treat the laid-up period as three months and award a sum of Rs.27,000/- (9,000X3) towards 'loss of income during the laid-up period' as against Rs.14,0"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "75e9ba8bb2f54679905c378c48b96114_36",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In that view of the matter, the claimant is entitled to a sum of Rs.20,000/- towards 'Food, nutrition, conveyance NC: 2024:KHC:43753 and attendant charges' as against Rs.10,000/- and 4,200/- awarded by the Tribunal.\n17."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4bc6cc64853c4025ae09bf15e6615c15_37",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Consequently, the award of the Tribunal is modified and the claimant in MFA No.1442/2018 would be entitled to the following compensation:\n As awarded As  by the awarded  Sl. Compensation  Tribunal by this  No. under different  Court  Heads "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3fb1379ae8b844c3af4fa1f784310406_38",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "during the laid-up  period"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f868d2fa9cda4c2d85324810f45dc6d5_40",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, the claimant in MFA No.1442/2018 is held entitled to the total compensation of Rs.5,73,600/- as against Rs.3,24,200/-, along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till its realization."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7855ed4890c4363b623de329c652c4f_41",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. The appeal insofar as the other claimant is concerned, i.e., Mr. Ramaraj in MFA No.1441/2018,\nthe Tribunal has awarded a global compensation of Rs.25,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "73934f3cc5ec49208d5fecd9a206c7be_42",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. The evidence on record indicates that the claimant had suffered simple injuries for which the claimant had spent a sum of Rs.13,950/- towards treatment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9b6b73f91e5048f3b1b073813c720034_43",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "21. In my view, it is appropriate to enhance the global compensation from Rs.25,000/- to Rs.40,000/-."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aded81b17a144048bd85132c4ee4ab45_44",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. The Insurance Company is directed to deposit the amount of compensation awarded within two months from the date of receipt of a certified copy of this judgment."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f21aabb1307840be99750695a9fdeaa5_45",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. The disbursement of the compensation amount shall be in terms of the award of the Tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f69aeff3fb5243abaf21c49a7fe6b625_47",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "These appeals are, accordingly, allowed in part."
    }
